1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
I have a terrible headache and a sore throat.

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:06,350
Oh, that sounds rough. Do you have a fever too?

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:10,220
I think so. I feel really warm and achy all over.

4
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:14,250
You should probably see a doctor. Do you want me to drive you?

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,320
That would be great, thanks. I really appreciate it.

6
00:00:17,669 --> 00:00:19,989
No problem at all. Let's go right now.
